{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50361","headline":"敦煌廿咏（并序） 十四、半壁树咏 · 敦煌人作品[一]","name":"敦煌廿咏（并序） 十四、半壁树咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"半壁生奇木，盘根到水涯。\n高柯宠（笼）宿雾，密叶隐朝霞。\n二月含青翠，三秋带紫花。\n森森神树下，祈赛不应赊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"敦煌人作品[一]","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50361.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50361","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}